      "speaker_name": "Deputy Pearse Doherty",
      "speaker_member_code": "Pearse-Doherty.S.2007-07-23",
      "speech_text": "I move amendment No. 1: In page 1, in Schedule 2, inserted by paragraph (1), to delete from the row dated “14 October 2026” down to and including the row dated “1 May 2030” and sub",
      "word_count": "66"
    },
    {
      "speech_id": "speech:fb291ca929ad60d2931f10a7",
      "debate_id": "https://data.oireachtas.ie/akn/ie/debateRecord/dail/2026-08-28/debate/main",
      "debate_date": "2026-08-28",
